=== Wrong-type target (INT) → ERROR for all three ===
SELECT JSON_ARRAY_APPEND(42, '$', 1);
ERROR 3146: Invalid data type for JSON data in argument 1 to function json_array_append; a JSON string or JSON type is required.
SELECT JSON_ARRAY_INSERT(42, '$[0]', 1);
ERROR 3146: Invalid data type for JSON data in argument 1 to function json_array_insert; a JSON string or JSON type is required.
SELECT JSON_REMOVE(42, '$.a');
ERROR 3146: Invalid data type for JSON data in argument 1 to function json_remove; a JSON string or JSON type is required.
